<title>UK: Bacob O/S sets 250 mln mark 10-year step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Bacob O/S sets 250 mln mark 10-year step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BACOB OVERSEAS LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BACOB BANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN MARK  BASE     **3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *25.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+32.5 BP  PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  99.875    FULL FEES   40 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AT PAR ON 25.JUL.02 AND EACH COUPON DATE</p>
<p>		THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	    **STEPS UP TO 3ML+182.5 AFTER FIVE YEARS</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BELGIUM</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
